        "jsCode": "// Build initial POST state\nconst data = $input.first().json;\n\nconst now = new Date();\nconst day = now.getDay();\nconst diff = now.getDate() - day + (day === 0 ? -6 : 1);\nconst monday = new Date(now);\nmonday.setDate(diff);\nconst mondayStr = `${monday.getMonth()+1}/${monday.getDate()}/${monday.getFullYear()} 12:00:00 AM`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...data,\n    currentMonday: mondayStr,\n    weekIndex: 0,\n    slotsFound: false,\n    foundSlots: [],\n    done: false\n  }\n}];"
